title: "MAGPIE: Manipulation Architecture for Grasping and Perception in Intelligent Experiments"
abstract: >-
  An open, 3D-printed, force-controlled two-finger robotic hand with a depth
  camera in its palm, and the Python stack that drives it: perception,
  force-controlled grasping, behaviour trees and PDDL replanning.
type: software
